    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community includes neighborhoods like Ridgewood and stretches as far south as the small Elk River area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pine_Hills%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Pine Hills sits at 40°43′59″N 124°09′08″W, placing it just north of the San Joaquin Valley.",
